          "content": {
            "id": "321d663d-ad44-3c64-93ae-ea67da2083c0",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Big Bank earnings on deck: Key themes to watch",
            "description": "<p>Big Bank earnings kick off with Goldman Sachs (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GS\">GS</a>), JPMorgan Chase (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/JPM\">JPM</a>), Wells Fargo (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/WFC\">WFC</a>), and Citi (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/C\">C</a>) reporting third quarter results on Tuesday.</p>\n<p>Yahoo Finance Senior Banking Reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/david-hollerith/\">David Hollerith</a> outlines what he's watching for during earnings.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/morning-brief/\">Morning Brief</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Big Bank earnings kick off with Goldman Sachs (GS), JPMorgan Chase (JPM), Wells Fargo (WFC), and Citi (C) reporting third quarter results on Tuesday. Yahoo Finance Senior Banking Reporter David Hollerith outlines what he's watching for during earnings. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Morning Brief.",
            "pubDate": "2025-10-13T14:28:13Z",
